CORE
main.py
--unwind 24 --no-unwinding-assertions --python-max-list-length 32
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
python-model-bound.*FAILURE
--
Without the flag both functions fail with python-model-bound at 16
(the loud fail-closed capacity property). The bound properties may
appear as SUCCESS here; only a FAILURE is forbidden.
